+       function(obj, x) predict(obj, proeve[x,], type="class"),
size=3,maxit=1000,skip=T, entropy= T, trace=F)

I get 10 fold CV and I can extract a misclassification error rate from res.nnet.

But using the optional weight parameter (function = nnet, weight=w) does not
work and I can't figure out why. Weight is a column named w in my dataframe
"proeve". I get the following error:

 res.nnet <- CVtest(
