I. Sometimes it might be worthwhile to evaluate the visualization against
random noise or permuted data 

for a possibly interesting example see

[1999] All maps of parameter estimates are misleading.
{\em Statistics in Medicine}, to appear.
(Andrew Gelman and Phillip N. Price)
http://www.stat.columbia.edu/~gelman/research/published/

