From: y0004379 at tu-bs.de (Peter Malewski)
Date: Mon, 13 Dec 1999 11:41:34 +0100
Subject: Re: [S] Dose escalation (non S+)
In-Reply-To: <001F7A6A.C21441@eu.pnu.com>
