Peter,

Am I wrong: if you observe the event "response" for *each* patient, the
response in

 glm(response~dose + other.vars, family=binomial(link = "logit"))

is constant, so I wouldn't expect that glm works. Survreg() should do in
either case, censored or not. However, perhaps we should stress, that in the
censored case more strict assumptions are involved, than just assume that
each patient will respond in the infinite future.

Patrick,

