discussed in my Ph.D. thesis, of which a short GERMAN version is available
on the web under http://www.geocities.com/Tokyo/Bay/5663/p_kpromo.htm#2.4
An english version will be available by the beginning of next year.

Best

Jens Oehlschlaegel-Akiyoshi

