On Thu, 16 Dec 1999, Nicole DePriest wrote:

> I am currently debugging some C code for a program I am using via the .C
> interface in Splus.  When I update the C code I run the make command with
> no problem.  However, in order for the updates to be reflected in my S
> session I have to get out of and back into Splus.  Is there a way to avoid
> this?  
> 
